            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you're running a trucking company, every decision counts, especially when it involves purchasing a new rig for your fleet. Choosing the right commercial truck trader can mean the difference between reliable performance and long-term headaches. And in an industry where uptime equals income, that choice matters.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we've helped Florida truck owners, operators, and fleet managers invest in trucks that work just as hard as they do. Whether you're expanding your fleet or replacing a workhorse, here's what you should look for in a commercial truck trader to make sure you're getting the right equipment, service, and support.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-track-record",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Proven Track Record in the Industry",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "track-record"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-track-record-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When evaluating truck traders, look for one with years of experience and a strong presence in the market. Reputation isn't built overnight; it's earned through consistent service, quality equipment, and taking care of customers long after the keys change hands.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-track-record-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International has been serving Florida for 30 years. As the state's exclusive International® Truck dealer, we don't just know the industry; we're rooted in it. From Tampa to Sarasota and beyond, our team supports customers at every level, whether you're operating one truck or managing a fleet.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-inventory",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Variety and Availability in Inventory",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "inventory"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-inventory-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Don't waste time bouncing between dealers. A strong commercial truck trader will offer a wide selection of new trucks, including vocational, long-haul, and day cab models, all ready to roll.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-inventory-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we stock a range of new International® models on the lot and have access to an even larger catalog for custom orders. Whether you're hauling freight across state lines or running local delivery routes, we've got options that fit.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-inventory-3-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-inventory-3",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
                          "borderColor": "line",
                          "paddingTop": 26,
                          "paddingRight": 28,
                          "paddingBottom": 26,
                          "paddingLeft": 28,
                          "marginTop": 8,
                          "marginBottom": 34
                        }
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "co-inventory-3-cta",
                          "type": "buttons",
                          "props": {
                            "align": "left",
                            "items": [
                              {
                                "ctaId": "browse-new-trucks",
                                "label": "New Truck Inventory →",
                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-parts-service",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Quality Parts and Service for Every Brand",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "parts-service"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-parts-service-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Here's the truth: most fleets include more than one truck brand. A great commercial truck trader won't turn you away because your equipment isn't what they sell. Sun State International is built differently. Our Parts & Service Department supports all makes and models, not just International®. With certified technicians and five service centers across Florida, we're here to keep your fleet moving regardless of the badge on the hood.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-financing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Flexible Financing Options",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "financing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Buying a truck is a big investment, and a good dealer will work with you to make it manageable. At Sun State International, we offer in-house financing support and can connect you with trusted lenders who specialize in commercial vehicles. We even offer open lines of credit for parts and service to make running your business easier.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-transparent-pricing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Transparent Pricing",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "transparent-pricing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-transparent-pricing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Hidden fees and unclear contracts are a red flag. A reputable truck trader will break everything down up front. At Sun State International, our sales team is trained to be transparent, professional, and helpful, not pushy. We don't just want to sell you a truck, we want to earn your trust and your repeat business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-word-of-mouth",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Look for Word-of-Mouth Credibility",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "word-of-mouth"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-word-of-mouth-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "In the trucking world, word gets around. Ask fellow owner-operators who they trust and why. If a dealer delivers consistent quality and stands behind their product, you'll hear about it.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-word-of-mouth-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International is proud to be the go-to for companies like Publix and local school districts across Florida. Our repeat customers and long-term relationships speak louder than any sales pitch. Don't just take our word for it, check out our customer stories and video testimonials on our site.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-local-support",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Local Support You Can Count On",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "local-support"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-support-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We know that when something breaks down, it's not just an inconvenience; it's lost revenue. That's why we maintain five physical locations across Florida and offer responsive, reliable service that gets you back on the road quickly. Our team lives and works in your community, and we treat every customer like a neighbor.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-red-flags",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Red Flags to Avoid",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "red-flags"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-red-flags-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not every dealer is created equal. Here are a few warning signs that you're not working with a commercial truck trader you can trust:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-red-flags-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "mark": "cross",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Limited inventory with no ability to order specific builds"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "No service department or one that only services their own sales"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Vague pricing or financing terms"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "No support after purchase"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-red-flags-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you run into any of the above, it may be time to find a better dealer.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-ready-to-upgrade",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready to Upgrade Your Fleet?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "ready-to-upgrade"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-to-upgrade-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "You don't have time to chase down parts, coordinate with multiple vendors, or get bounced around from one salesperson to another. You need a commercial truck trader who gets the job done right and treats you like more than a number.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-to-upgrade-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we're here to help you find the truck that works for your business, your team, and your bottom line. Check out our inventory online or stop by one of our Florida locations today.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-ready-to-upgrade-3",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-new-trucks",
                        "label": "See Our Inventory"
                      },
                      {
                        "ctaId": "contact-us",
                        "label": "Contact Us",
                        "style": "secondary"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
